        <mxCell id="Ww_3Ysm3qYvl4xZfR5K2-11" edge="1" parent="1" source="Ww_3Ysm3qYvl4xZfR5K2-7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="Ww_3Ysm3qYvl4xZfR5K2-10" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ww_3Ysm3qYvl4xZfR5K2-7" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Adverser possession of property&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;In their ruling do they site to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Does a Judge prioritize a&amp;nbsp;Utilitarian stand point (Earning theory)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(4) Cleaning cobweb theory - keeping old claims and mistakes from changing the present too much&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="390" x="160" y="745" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ww_3Ysm3qYvl4xZfR5K2-10" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Main point of analysis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="112.5" width="165" x="-100" y="777.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ww_3Ysm3qYvl4xZfR5K2-12" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Adverser possession of property&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;In this case... who are the attorneys, same school? interpersonal relations? Any other personal info we can gather&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="390" x="150" y="1010" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vO51LSBisrAsBUFd8CkB-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Adverser possession of property&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) &lt;b&gt;Sleeping&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;theory&lt;/b&gt;: law punishes those who sleep on their rights - negligent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) &lt;b&gt;Earning theory&lt;/b&gt;: Law favors the owner who is using the land productively, not letting it go to waste. Utilitarian stand point - reward the worker, penalize the slaker&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) &lt;b&gt;Psychological theor&lt;/b&gt;y: A person puts down roots in a land, even if stolen after ten years would be a psychological blow. Loss adverstion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot; style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;AKA: *The pain of loosing something you have is much greater than loosing something you never really use.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot; style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;*Prioritizes the real human connection to the land&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(4) &lt;b&gt;Cleaning cobwebs theory&lt;/b&gt;: adverse possession protects from old stale invisible claims, like mistakes in deeds. Assurance that title is clean.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="295" width="380" x="155" y="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
